WEBVTT

01:29.480 --> 01:33.110
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.509 --> 01:36.120
[Episode 13]

01:45.479 --> 01:46.440
You must be mistaken.

01:46.440 --> 01:47.560
Take a closer look.

01:47.640 --> 01:48.720
Man is so delicate—

01:48.720 --> 01:49.400
there's no way

01:49.400 --> 01:51.660
she could have done something like this.

01:53.360 --> 01:53.960
What's the matter?

01:53.960 --> 01:55.880
Your identity has been exposed—

01:55.920 --> 01:57.200
are you lashing out in shame?

01:57.200 --> 01:58.160
You murderer!

01:58.160 --> 01:59.259
That's not true!

01:59.400 --> 02:00.320
It was not me.

02:00.580 --> 02:02.420
It was them who forced me!

02:02.450 --> 02:04.330
They forced me!

02:04.800 --> 02:06.620
They forced me...

02:07.160 --> 02:08.979
They forced me...

02:11.920 --> 02:12.720
Man,

02:13.200 --> 02:15.570
I know you have your reasons,

02:15.600 --> 02:16.600
right?

02:16.760 --> 02:17.880
Man,

02:18.600 --> 02:19.740
I trust you.

02:20.440 --> 02:21.829
Do you trust me?

02:24.670 --> 02:26.090
I want to know—

02:26.520 --> 02:28.270
what really happened?

02:31.170 --> 02:32.690
They all deserve to die…

02:33.370 --> 02:35.160
all of them…

02:35.950 --> 02:37.650
They all deserve to die!

02:38.720 --> 02:40.720
They all deserve to die!

02:41.880 --> 02:44.100
They all deserve to die!

02:49.060 --> 02:50.780
I was never loved as a child.

02:51.370 --> 02:52.950
My parents were gone,

02:53.190 --> 02:54.520
my grandfather too—

02:55.150 --> 02:56.750
just me alone.

02:56.900 --> 02:58.980
The other kids always bullied me,

02:59.120 --> 03:01.400
calling me a jinx.

03:05.860 --> 03:07.580
The adults turned a blind eye.

03:08.570 --> 03:11.070
Even stealing a bun would get me scolded.

03:18.050 --> 03:20.650
Let go of me! Let go!

03:20.680 --> 03:22.160
Struggling won't help,

03:22.240 --> 03:23.680
-Jinx!
-Let go!

03:23.680 --> 03:25.480
Your body's going to be used
sooner or later—

03:25.480 --> 03:27.280
so it might as well be by me first.

03:35.810 --> 03:40.130
The village women forced me
to work all day,

03:40.980 --> 03:44.590
and at night the men took turns
abusing me.

03:46.000 --> 03:48.340
They didn't even see me as human.

03:48.370 --> 03:50.180
I'd been pent up for days.

03:55.960 --> 03:59.280
So I poisoned the well,

03:59.560 --> 04:02.490
and killed everyone in the village
with my own hands.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.520
They all deserve to die...

05:02.680 --> 05:04.520
They all deserve to die!

05:04.840 --> 05:06.560
They all deserve to die!

05:07.600 --> 05:09.440
It's them who deserve it!

05:09.800 --> 05:11.840
-They deserve it.
-Don't be afraid.

05:12.090 --> 05:13.050
Yanzhi...

05:13.240 --> 05:14.580
Yanzhi,

05:15.690 --> 05:18.050
I just wanted to survive.

05:18.160 --> 05:19.900
They forced me...

05:19.930 --> 05:20.750
It's all over now.

05:20.750 --> 05:22.290
It's all over.

05:22.580 --> 05:24.250
No one can hurt you anymore.

05:44.159 --> 05:45.280
Tower Master,

05:45.280 --> 05:48.400
the bodies of Kou Wan and Zan Hua
have been recovered.

05:48.420 --> 05:51.730
Although they committed
capital crimes,

05:52.120 --> 05:54.520
they've been with me for so many years.

05:54.840 --> 05:56.440
Find a secluded spot

05:56.750 --> 05:59.580
and give them a proper burial
on my behalf.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.160
Yes.

06:02.800 --> 06:03.600
Wujiu,

06:05.000 --> 06:06.360
how are your injuries?

06:08.480 --> 06:10.360
Thanks to your concern, Tower Master,

06:10.360 --> 06:12.220
my injuries are nothing serious.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.320
Young Master,

06:19.320 --> 06:20.870
I wasn't able
to come farther to meet you.

06:20.870 --> 06:22.160
Please forgive me.

06:23.200 --> 06:24.600
No need for formalities.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.800
Having heard so much about Lingya Tower,

06:26.800 --> 06:28.930
I came especially to see it for myself.

06:46.540 --> 06:49.000
Welcome to the fourth level
of Lingya Tower.

06:49.120 --> 06:51.000
Making it this far is no small feat—

06:51.000 --> 06:53.070
so I hope you'll cherish it.

06:53.640 --> 06:55.400
Cherish it?
We're not even having an easy time.

06:55.400 --> 06:57.920
-What's there to cherish?
-The first four levels of Lingya Tower

06:57.920 --> 07:01.020
are about seeking survival. The next
four levels are about seeking death.

07:01.020 --> 07:04.140
The first four are nothing more
than a poetic game.

07:04.830 --> 07:07.160
Only if you make it alive
to the fifth level

07:07.360 --> 07:10.710
will you understand what it truly means
to be trapped in a hell with no escape—

07:10.710 --> 07:12.440
even death will be out of reach.

07:12.570 --> 07:14.050
So cherish

07:14.070 --> 07:17.310
this final survival challenge.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.400
Alright, I've said all that needs saying.

07:20.400 --> 07:21.820
Take care of yourselves.

07:22.520 --> 07:24.480
Those who wish to join this death match

07:24.480 --> 07:26.140
can follow the mute servants.

07:26.640 --> 07:28.570
Those who don't… fine,

07:28.920 --> 07:32.560
you can stay here and slowly wait to die.

07:39.440 --> 07:40.730
You…

07:41.680 --> 07:42.760
Enough talk!

07:43.159 --> 07:44.490
We've all come this far.

07:48.400 --> 07:49.520
Without us,

07:49.560 --> 07:51.560
you might not have even made it here.

07:55.350 --> 07:56.150
Let's go.

08:06.930 --> 08:08.730
Take this letter to the capital.

08:11.360 --> 08:13.120
But I'm the voice-keeper of Level 1…

08:13.120 --> 08:13.720
Inside the tower...

08:13.720 --> 08:16.240
You don't need to worry
about what's happening inside the Tower.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.900
I've got it all under control.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.060
What's the matter?

08:21.140 --> 08:22.400
Get moving.

08:22.400 --> 08:22.880
But I…

08:22.900 --> 08:24.430
Escort her out of the Tower.

08:42.830 --> 08:45.130
I've already sent Wujiu away.

08:45.280 --> 08:46.520
From here on,

08:47.000 --> 08:48.590
do whatever you need to do.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.250
Don't worry, Tower Master.

08:51.720 --> 08:54.840
I'll make sure
she suffers more than death.

09:05.560 --> 09:08.030
You rarely seem so unsettled.

09:08.520 --> 09:09.580
What's the matter?

09:11.200 --> 09:14.200
The Tower Master suddenly sent me
to deliver a letter.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.520
I'm a bit worried.

09:16.570 --> 09:18.930
Are you worried our plan
might be exposed,

09:19.380 --> 09:21.380
or about your apprentice's safety?

09:26.040 --> 09:26.840
Both.

09:27.320 --> 09:28.240
Don't worry.

09:28.770 --> 09:30.920
I've arranged for someone
to keep an eye on her.

09:30.920 --> 09:32.580
You should be careful as well.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.320
If nothing changes,

09:35.200 --> 09:37.260
everything will proceed as planned.

09:38.760 --> 09:39.640
Zhuang Wujiu,

09:44.570 --> 09:46.490
I hope you will
put the greater good first.

09:46.490 --> 09:48.220
[Eternal Prosperity of Lingya Tower]

09:51.840 --> 09:53.280
I'm worried she might be in danger.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.210
Keep an eye on her

09:54.460 --> 09:55.390
until I get back.

10:09.070 --> 10:11.160
[Hall of Elegance]

10:11.670 --> 10:14.170
[Floor 4: Hall of Elegance]

10:17.260 --> 10:19.240
This Lingya Tower really knows
how to make things interesting, huh?

10:19.240 --> 10:20.300
First the village,

10:20.300 --> 10:21.230
then the academy,

10:21.230 --> 10:22.260
then the caves…

10:22.360 --> 10:24.920
and now the Flower Pavilion.

10:26.460 --> 10:28.380
These paintings are amazing.

10:28.980 --> 10:31.850
Could these be the winners?

10:33.140 --> 10:35.420
Music, chess, calligraphy, painting…

10:36.390 --> 10:37.390
And archery.

10:40.460 --> 10:42.630
[Hall of Elegance]

10:42.760 --> 10:43.920
Everyone,

10:43.940 --> 10:45.200
thank you for waiting.

10:51.000 --> 10:53.310
[Wan Hongliu, Level 4 Voice-Keeper]

10:53.680 --> 10:57.760
I am Wan Hongliu,
the voice-keeper of this level.

10:59.160 --> 11:01.880
Welcome to this level's death match—

11:02.290 --> 11:03.740
the Hall of Elegance.

11:05.110 --> 11:06.510
The Hall of Elegance?

11:06.960 --> 11:08.000
What is that?

11:08.120 --> 11:08.960
Don't worry.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.600
Let me explain everything.

11:13.150 --> 11:13.550
[Hall of Elegance]

11:20.200 --> 11:22.560
Before entering the death match,

11:22.560 --> 11:25.280
you need to choose a team—

11:25.800 --> 11:27.720
blue or red.

11:28.450 --> 11:29.750
No matter what,

11:29.770 --> 11:31.630
we're sticking together, right?

11:32.520 --> 11:33.780
We choose the Red Team.

11:35.520 --> 11:37.050
We also choose the Red Team.

11:37.080 --> 11:38.060
That was fast.

11:38.640 --> 11:40.370
Then only the Blue Team is left.

11:40.410 --> 11:41.430
May I ask, President,

11:41.430 --> 11:43.310
is there a limit on team size?

11:43.330 --> 11:45.000
What if the numbers aren't even?

11:45.000 --> 11:46.400
Lingya Tower never cares

11:46.520 --> 11:48.540
about such minor details.

11:48.570 --> 11:50.070
Team selection

11:50.120 --> 11:51.560
is entirely up to you.

11:51.580 --> 11:52.910
We choose the Blue Team.

11:57.400 --> 11:59.860
I actually wanted the Blue Team all along.

12:00.160 --> 12:01.180
It doesn't bother me.

12:01.180 --> 12:03.120
I'll just follow you guys anyway.

12:03.150 --> 12:03.950
Exactly.

12:04.110 --> 12:06.910
Just… don't end up opposing that person.

12:26.470 --> 12:27.670
Smart move.

12:28.520 --> 12:31.180
You know it—
we're still the ones in charge here.

12:35.640 --> 12:38.390
All right, now that the teams are set,

12:38.560 --> 12:40.680
let me explain the rules.

12:40.720 --> 12:43.320
This match is called
the Hall of Elegance,

12:43.320 --> 12:45.320
so don't expect

12:45.320 --> 12:47.920
any crude hand-to-hand fighting.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.770
It consists of three rounds:

12:49.790 --> 12:51.260
first, music and dance;

12:51.520 --> 12:52.960
second, poetry and chess;

12:52.960 --> 12:54.560
third, archery and etiquette.

12:54.560 --> 12:57.920
Win two out of three,
and your team prevails.

12:58.400 --> 13:02.080
The winners will
all advance to the fifth level.

13:02.940 --> 13:04.900
Just dancing or playing chess?

13:04.960 --> 13:06.840
That doesn't sound too difficult.

13:06.840 --> 13:07.420
Yeah,

13:07.720 --> 13:09.760
it doesn't seem as terrifying

13:09.760 --> 13:10.540
as the previous levels.

13:10.540 --> 13:11.220
Right.

13:11.300 --> 13:12.500
This is a death match—

13:14.000 --> 13:15.310
you mustn't take it lightly.

13:15.310 --> 13:16.710
Got it, got it.

13:16.960 --> 13:19.090
There's one thing I forgot to mention:

13:19.320 --> 13:21.760
this match has a unique twist—

13:22.120 --> 13:25.850
I, the voice-keeper, will be
joining the competition personally.

13:27.410 --> 13:29.290
The voice-keeper is joining personally?

13:29.290 --> 13:30.640
Then, President Wan,

13:30.960 --> 13:32.360
which team will you be on?

13:34.020 --> 13:36.560
Naturally, I'll be
the captain of the Red Team.

13:36.560 --> 13:39.030
Wait, what? That's not fair!

13:39.360 --> 13:41.760
I look forward
to your guidance, everyone.

13:42.160 --> 13:43.480
There's little time—

13:43.760 --> 13:45.290
hurry to the West Courtyard

13:45.400 --> 13:47.660
and reunite with your former teammates.

14:07.020 --> 14:09.220
She instructed us to the West Courtyard,

14:09.220 --> 14:11.150
but no one's here to show us the way.

14:12.430 --> 14:15.470
This level looks much bigger
than the ones before.

14:16.320 --> 14:18.450
They're trying to be mysterious, huh?

14:19.600 --> 14:20.840
What's this about?

14:21.080 --> 14:22.360
Playing a game with the voice-keeper?

14:22.360 --> 14:23.740
Are we really competing?

14:23.740 --> 14:25.460
Let's not be so pessimistic.

14:26.160 --> 14:27.480
We know each other—

14:27.710 --> 14:29.880
we'll be more in sync than they ever are.

14:29.880 --> 14:30.600
Yeah,

14:30.730 --> 14:31.820
Yanzhi is right.

14:32.220 --> 14:33.280
We've been through

14:33.310 --> 14:35.640
plenty of storms already on this journey.

14:36.530 --> 14:37.880
Hey, weren't our teammates

14:37.880 --> 14:39.400
supposed to be here

14:39.430 --> 14:41.110
in the West Courtyard?

14:41.300 --> 14:43.140
I don't see a single one of them.

14:46.960 --> 14:48.340
Ah! It hurts!

14:48.360 --> 14:50.280
I can't take it…

14:50.320 --> 14:51.500
Captain, you…

14:51.940 --> 14:53.410
I haven't even started the match,

14:53.410 --> 14:54.670
and I'm already…

14:59.930 --> 15:00.910
Captain!

15:01.280 --> 15:03.080
Captain!

15:07.890 --> 15:10.350
I can't take it…

15:10.900 --> 15:12.080
Look up.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.320
Ah…

15:14.340 --> 15:15.670
It hurts, Captain!

15:15.690 --> 15:16.460
It hurts so much.

15:16.460 --> 15:17.560
I can't…

15:17.580 --> 15:19.110
It's killing me. It really hurts…

15:19.110 --> 15:21.170
You won't manage without some force.

15:21.180 --> 15:22.800
You're too tense.

15:22.820 --> 15:25.270
How else are we supposed
to get through this?

15:25.270 --> 15:26.070
Ahem...

15:28.420 --> 15:30.760
You're new here?

15:30.980 --> 15:31.780
Yes.

15:32.560 --> 15:34.280
Perfect, perfect!

15:34.280 --> 15:35.880
You all look nice,

15:35.900 --> 15:38.240
and your bodies are in great shape.

15:40.920 --> 15:43.270
Clearly, you can sing and dance.

15:43.800 --> 15:46.760
You're… the captain?

15:46.790 --> 15:47.360
Yes,

15:47.380 --> 15:48.820
I'm Qi Songyue.

15:49.240 --> 15:51.200
How old are you?

15:51.230 --> 15:52.360
Have you come of age?

15:53.120 --> 15:54.840
Get down and keep going.

15:56.700 --> 15:57.670
Mm…

15:57.690 --> 16:00.350
I'm the most musically skilled
among us.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.000
If you are better than me,

16:02.000 --> 16:03.600
the captain can defer to you.

16:04.760 --> 16:05.920
We're new here

16:05.940 --> 16:07.520
and obviously not as familiar
with this place.

16:07.520 --> 16:08.920
You should take the lead.

16:09.230 --> 16:10.880
We're all unfortunate souls.

16:10.880 --> 16:11.760
Age doesn't matter.

16:11.760 --> 16:13.400
We just have to look out for each other.

16:13.400 --> 16:15.840
So… what were you just doing?

16:15.860 --> 16:17.680
Oh, you didn't know?

16:17.800 --> 16:19.220
The first round is music and dance.

16:19.220 --> 16:21.120
Everyone performs a group dance together.

16:21.120 --> 16:23.080
If anyone makes a mistake along the way
and we end up losing,

16:23.080 --> 16:25.520
they will face punishment.

16:25.800 --> 16:27.040
Last time we lost,

16:27.060 --> 16:29.920
the few who were taken
away still haven't returned.

16:31.480 --> 16:33.720
Hey, keep pressing down like that.

16:34.570 --> 16:37.490
But President Wan didn't even tell us.

16:37.520 --> 16:38.520
I told you so.

16:38.800 --> 16:41.220
That Master Wan
is the sneakiest of them all.

16:41.220 --> 16:41.780
So…

16:42.080 --> 16:43.330
what do we do?

16:43.600 --> 16:45.120
If I don't dance well,

16:45.120 --> 16:45.760
won't we…

16:45.760 --> 16:46.920
Hey, don't worry.

16:47.100 --> 16:48.540
Look, we're new here—

16:48.570 --> 16:50.890
aren't there a few newcomers
on the other side as well?

16:50.890 --> 16:51.690
Captain,

16:52.320 --> 16:53.960
do you know what they're up to?

16:53.960 --> 16:55.330
Normally, President Wan

16:55.330 --> 16:57.020
and the others practice at the Qunhua Hall
in the East Courtyard.

16:57.020 --> 16:59.150
Could you take us to observe, Captain?

16:59.360 --> 17:01.360
As the saying goes, know your enemy.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.080
That way, we won't fall
into chaos ourselves.
